[node name="Shower" type="Node3D"]
metadata/_doc = "Walk-in shower 2.80 x 1.40 m with a frameless glass screen (entry at the -X end), rain head, slide rail, wall mixer and a marble shelf. Origin = footprint center on the floor; the back wall is at z -0.70, +Z points into the room. The flow lever turns ±90 degrees (+ rain head, - hand shower) and clicks into off and both ends; the thermostat dial turns ±120 degrees with a click at 38 °C (indicator up). The hand shower sits in its holder until grabbed; put it back near the holder and it clicks in again. No water yet."

